ds simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ice cream"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a frozen sweet food made of milk, cream, and sugar "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love ice cream."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about desserts."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vanilla"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a taste made from the beans of a plant "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My favorite flavor is vanilla."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pie "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "fruit baked inside a pastry "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like apple pie."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "favorite "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "what you like the most "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Apple pie is my favorite kind."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pudding "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a sweet, creamy dish "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't like pudding."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fruit tart "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "fruit baked (a pie) without a top on it "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have fruit. We can make a fruit tart."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tub "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small container made of plastic with a lid "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's get a tub of vanilla ice cream!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Making Suggestions with Imperatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use Imperatives to make suggestions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"italic\"> \u201cLet's + base of verb\u201d </span>(without to) when you want to include the speaker in the suggestion: "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Let's make dinner. <br />Let's bake a pie. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Another way to make a suggestion is to use <span class=\"italic\">\u201cWhy don't + subject + base of verb\u201d</span> (without to): "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Why don't we make dinner? <br />Why don't you try that?</span>"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le04ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pretend you are the salesperson at a bakery. Your friend wants to buy desserts at the bakery."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about the desserts. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " Your friend asks questions about desserts."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make suggestions on what to buy."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about desserts."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make suggestions about desserts."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask questions about desserts."}]}], "type": "sena"}